    "text": "If the system of equations <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo></math> <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math> has inifinitely many solutions, then <math><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math> equals",
